  "reasoning": "The defendant illegally cultivated poppy plants (罂粟) on his contracted land. Under Chinese criminal law, the illegal cultivation of drug plants such as poppy constitutes the crime of illegal cultivation of drug raw plants. The appropriate charge is therefore \"非法种植罂粟\" (illegal poppy cultivation).",
